# 每次新一轮修改 @run；重复提交成功订单时不要改业务号。
# 基线 B=余额，S=库存。执行顺序和 SQL 见同目录 README.md。
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8081
@run = manual-001

### 1. 查询验证前基线 B、S
GET {{base}}/api/xa/state

### 2. 成功下单
# 预期 200 / PAID
POST {{base}}/api/xa/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "xa-{{run}}-ok",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### 3. 核对成功订单、余额 B-10、库存 S-1
GET {{base}}/api/xa/state

### 4.order. AFTER_ORDER 故障回滚
# 预期错误响应；最终不得留下此订单，余额和库存恢复到步骤 3
POST {{base}}/api/xa/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "xa-{{run}}-after-order",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "AFTER_ORDER"
}

### 4.stock. AFTER_STOCK 故障回滚
# 预期错误响应；最终不得留下此订单，余额和库存恢复到步骤 3
POST {{base}}/api/xa/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "xa-{{run}}-after-stock",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "AFTER_STOCK"
}

### 4.account. AFTER_ACCOUNT 故障回滚
# 预期错误响应；最终不得留下此订单，余额和库存恢复到步骤 3
POST {{base}}/api/xa/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "xa-{{run}}-after-account",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "AFTER_ACCOUNT"
}

### 5. 查询三种故障后的两库状态
# 预期 B-10 / S-1，三个 after-* 订单不存在
GET {{base}}/api/xa/state

### 6. 重复提交步骤 2 的业务号
# 预期错误响应，不再次扣减
POST {{base}}/api/xa/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "xa-{{run}}-ok",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### 8. 最终结果：只保留 ok 订单，余额 B-10，库存 S-1
GET {{base}}/api/xa/state
